{
  "name": "Helpdesk E: Item received sync",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## E: Item received → exact sheet row (tab: Item Transfers)\n1. Edit **Config** (Spreadsheet ID, sheetName).\n2. Attach the same credentials as workflow D.\n3. The row is found by Transfer ID and updated by its row number, only if EXACTLY one row matches.\nZero rows → 404 row_missing, several → 409 duplicate_rows. This workflow never inserts a row.\nSee n8n/README.md.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "a5a2021c-697f-50bd-9eaf-79be3d459614",
      "name": "Setup Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
